  "source_caveats": [
    "Apple takes a 15-30% commission (`partner_share`) — `settled_amount` is after this deduction.",
    "`sale_or_return` = 'S' for sales, 'R' for refunds.",
    "`metadata_2` and `metadata_3` are report period start/end dates.",
    "Subscription products will have `start_date` and `end_date` populated.",
    "Apple pays in 45+ currencies — always check `currency` vs `currency_type`.",
    "Some financial amount fields are stored as Text; prefer mapped Decimal columns when available or cast explicitly."
  ],
